Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Desert Pursuit Line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 26
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected you, Wolffy, to turn into a yarn doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need to eat in that form?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need to drink water?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! I’ve already suffered the misfortune of turning into a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you guys have any sympathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just couldn’t help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, after the rift appeared…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen on the grassland?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That white monster appeared on the grassland too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You encountered it as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.19,0:01:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be constantly searching for that multicolored fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy is using drones to locate the source of these fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.39,0:01:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure we’ll have results soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, these powerful fragments must not fall into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me recap our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Our goal here is to bring Weslie and Wolffy back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.37,0:01:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we just need to find Weslie,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and find the fragment Mr. Slowy asked for,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.57,0:01:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,then we’ll…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,have the mission accomplished!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let’s see if the sandstorm has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems quiet outside now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The entrance is blocked; it won’t open at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a mechanical glove I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Wolffy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he think he looks cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be dangerous for Weslie here. Let’s go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Walking across a desert this big definitely won’t work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But the vehicle the Lord gave us is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, do you remember our invention at the Invention Camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you confident you can recreate it using these parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. It’s time to show my true skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.19,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Storm Tornado
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Roaring Dynamic Device
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:02:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,2.0 Upgraded
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, we’re coming to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Autopilot mode engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Mom is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll find out where she is once we see Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll get to the bottom of what happened back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong is a bad guy; he must be up to something sinister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally caught up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf, don’t even think about escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy approaching rapidly from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Automatic evasion engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quicksand zone 50 meters ahead; detour selected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no escape for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve got a problem, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The vehicle is stuck in the quicksand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way I’m letting you get away today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Find a way to get the vehicle out of the quicksand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of you, come with me and keep chasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do if Wolffy doesn’t come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just follow them for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys see a figure up ahead just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t see anything. Let’s keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need to catch up to Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I heard the sound of a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Weslie be nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you see anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be strange to find anyone in a desert this vast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The motorbike is stuck. Let’s get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, nowhere left to run, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s time to settle the score between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he dislike you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:06:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t know? You actually don’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The story of how you single-handedly destroyed a village spread all across Blue Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The village you destroyed…was my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How many villages did you destroy back then just to seize water sources?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my father…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t believe Big Sister would do such a thing; there must be a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone out there says she did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And she’s the only one capable of doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If not her, then who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m definitely going to finish you off this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, he’s on the tower to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible—a kid like you actually managed to find my location?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Those masks of yours won’t protect you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay here and wait to succumb to the miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.66,0:08:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do? We can’t get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky and Paddi have gone missing in the sandstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, everything is under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie, Ragdoll—you’re finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And me, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And me, Paddi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I give that entrance a 10 out of 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it’s you two—Guangzong’s underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected you to be one of Guangzong’s people too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all a misunderstanding; just let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in your explanations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let you off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won’t let you hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go after him; you two hold Cha Erlang back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t blow him up—he blew himself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to take her away, then come and get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I win, even with this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone! Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, thank goodness you’re still by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get back to the vehicle and regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, such immense power
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn’t seem to suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better hand it over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong’s suits…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re one of Guangzong’s people too.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
